@startuml System STM

'skinparam Linetype ortho
skinparam MaxMessageSize 70
mainframe **System STM\t**

state Off
state Idle
state Driving
state Pathfinding

Off : entry / Init, Power button pressed
Off : do / /'Potentially wait for power button pressed'/
Off : exit / Power button pressed

Idle : entry / Power button pressed, Pathfinding finished, Arrival at next location
Idle : do / Await action button pressed, Handle error
Idle : exit / Action button pressed

Driving : entry / Action button pressed [More ooms available on route, Pathfinding finished]
Driving : do / Perform driving instructions towards next room on route
Driving : exit / Arrival at next location

Pathfinding : entry / Action button pressed [Pathfinding not performed]
Pathfinding : do / Perform pathfinding calculations for given route
Pathfinding : exit / Pathfinding finished


[*] -d-> Off

Off -d-> Idle
Idle -u-> Off

Idle --> Driving : [More ooms available on route, Pathfinding finished]
Driving --> Idle : [Arrived at next location]

Idle --> Pathfinding : [Pathfinding not performed]
Pathfinding --> Idle : [Pathfinding finished]

Idle -d-> Idle : [Error occured]

@enduml